OL,3,GNEWSADrinkers raise a pint to Joe
OL,4,ALycett's #100 bar tab
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bell behind the bar rang just three
OL,7,Fhours after the pub opened, but instead
OL,8,Fof calling for last orders, it was the
OL,9,Fsignal for the dozens of people queuing
OL,10,Fto come and claim their free pint.
OL,12,FThey snaked through the tight corridors
OL,13,Fof the Hallamshire House in Sheffield
OL,14,Fearly evening on Friday for a slice of
OL,15,Fcomedian Joe Lycett's #100 bar tab.
OL,17,FIt was one of 30 pubs around the UK
OL,18,Fchosen by the Traitors star the
OL,19,Fprevious week on his Channel 4 show
OL,20,FLive from the Lycett Arms, when he told
OL,21,Fviewers: "Go and give them some love."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
